# Routing coverage — one Geofabrik area per line, resolved against
# https://download.geofabrik.de/europe/<area>-latest.osm.pbf
#
# Read by entrypoint.sh (inside the image, copied to /coverage.list) and by
# build-tiles.sh (on the host), so widening coverage is one edit rather than
# two that can disagree. VALHALLA_PBF_URLS still overrides it entirely.
#
# What is here and why: Norway + Sweden (home), the land corridor down to the
# North Sea ferries (Denmark, Germany, Netherlands, Belgium), and the British
# Isles — Great Britain, Ireland + Northern Ireland, and the Crown
# Dependencies, whose extracts are a few MB each and complete "the whole UK".
#
# Every left-driving country in Europe is in that last group; Malta and Cyprus
# are the only others on the continent and are left out only because no road
# reaches them from here. The admin DB covers them anyway, so adding them
# later is a one-line change with the driving side already correct.
norway
sweden
denmark
germany
netherlands
belgium
great-britain
ireland-and-northern-ireland
isle-of-man
guernsey-jersey
